#### Example 2: IRSA IAM Role Policy (Variation B)

```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "AllowS3GetObject",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": "s3:GetObject",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::BUCKET_NAME/*"
    },
    {
      "Sid": "AllowS3ListBucket",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": "s3:ListBucket",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::BUCKET_NAME"
    }
  ]
}
```
